{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tyler receives a sudden location from his missing brother\u2019s phone.<br>It leads him to a remote, fog-covered island \u2014 a place of cults, silence, and things best left forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He thought he came to rescue.<br>Instead, he walked into a nightmare.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Cinematic Psychological Horror Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bleak Haven is a survival horror game in which you'll explore abandoned villages, crypts, ruins, and underground chambers \u2014 each hiding twisted secrets and fragments of a lost past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/Gif_03.gif?t=1750795810\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Raw, Violent Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight against grotesque, humanoid abominations using blunt melee weapons and limited firearms.<br>Combat is fast, physical, and lethal.<br>Finishers allow you to execute enemies when caught off guard or weakened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/Gif_04v2-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1750795810\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Puzzle Solving and Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve environmental puzzles, uncover strange mechanisms, and investigate symbols and documents left behind by the cult and other survivors.<br>Progress through layered locations filled with traps, locked paths, and disturbing relics of rituals gone wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/Gif_06v2.gif?t=1750795810\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cinematic Storytelling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Built in Unreal Engine 5, Bleak Haven features performance-captured cutscenes, immersive voice acting, and a haunting atmosphere.<br>The story blends seamlessly into gameplay for a grounded, emotionally heavy experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/Gif_02.gif?t=1750795810\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566840?t=1750795810","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/0c6112ac24951b7f740e2d81693485603c657c30/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750795810","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/866b71f3981f0aba2b60d8b1c31ac86bc5c250c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750795810","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/866b71f3981f0aba2b60d8b1c31ac86bc5c250c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750795810","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tyler receives a sudden location from his missing brother\u2019s phone.<br>It leads him to a remote, fog-covered island \u2014 a place of cults, silence, and things best left forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He thought he came to rescue.<br>Instead, he walked into a nightmare.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Cinematic Psychological Horror Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bleak Haven is a survival horror game in which you'll explore abandoned villages, crypts, ruins, and underground chambers \u2014 each hiding twisted secrets and fragments of a lost past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/Gif_03.gif?t=1750795810\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Raw, Violent Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight against grotesque, humanoid abominations using blunt melee weapons and limited firearms.<br>Combat is fast, physical, and lethal.<br>Finishers allow you to execute enemies when caught off guard or weakened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/Gif_04v2-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1750795810\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Puzzle Solving and Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve environmental puzzles, uncover strange mechanisms, and investigate symbols and documents left behind by the cult and other survivors.<br>Progress through layered locations filled with traps, locked paths, and disturbing relics of rituals gone wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/Gif_06v2.gif?t=1750795810\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cinematic Storytelling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Built in Unreal Engine 5, Bleak Haven features performance-captured cutscenes, immersive voice acting, and a haunting atmosphere.<br>The story blends seamlessly into gameplay for a grounded, emotionally heavy experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/Gif_02.gif?t=1750795810\" /></div><